# Glorifier of Suffering: "you may sacrifice another creature or artifact. When you do, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to
# two target creatures." Two Moxen are available but only one permanent may be sacrificed (CR 701.21a: "a" is one), so
# naming both is refused. The sacrifice still happens when no target is chosen: "up to two" includes none (CR 601.2c), so
# the reflexive ability resolves with no target and nothing gets a counter.

